\section*{Implementation Notes (Phase 4--5)}

\subsection*{What Was Implemented}

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Snowbridge v1 full E2E}: Local Ethereum (Geth v1.17.1 + Lodestar v1.35.0) $\rightarrow$ Gateway contracts (16 deployed) $\rightarrow$ beacon relay + execution relay $\rightarrow$ Bridge Hub proof verification $\rightarrow$ XCM to AssetHub $\rightarrow$ Ether minted. Two successful token transfers were demonstrated.
    \item \textbf{Trust-minimized verification}: Bridge Hub's \texttt{ethereumBeaconClient} pallet verifies the Ethereum beacon chain state via a light client with 512 sync committee members. Cryptographic proof chain: receipt proof $\rightarrow$ execution proof $\rightarrow$ ancestry proof $\rightarrow$ beacon state root.
    \item \textbf{4-chain Zombienet topology}: Relay + Bridge Hub (1013) + AssetHub (1000) + Content Rights (100) with HRMP channels.
\end{itemize}

