\subsection*{Snowbridge Integration Challenges Resolved}

\begin{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{Fork version config format}: Relayer \texttt{forkVersions} expects epoch numbers, not hex version bytes --- caused silent Merkle proof failures (gindex 54 vs 86)
    \item \textbf{Beacon state service timing}: Must start immediately after Lodestar to cache proofs for each finalized epoch
    \item \textbf{Sovereign account funding}: Bridge Hub and AssetHub Snowbridge sovereign accounts must be funded for XCM execution
    \item \textbf{Lodestar preset compatibility}: Bridge Hub requires mainnet sync committee (512); Lodestar v1.41 dev mode forces minimal preset --- must use v1.35.0 with \texttt{LODESTAR\_PRESET=mainnet}
\end{enumerate}

Full details in \texttt{content-rights-parachain/docs/SNOWBRIDGE\_SESSION\_LOG.md}.

